msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/main/extensions/hibernate-orm/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/hibernate/orm/deployment/ImpliedBlockingPersistenceUnitTypeBuildItem.java[`io.quarkus.hibernate.orm.deployment.ImpliedBlockingPersistenceUnitTypeBuildItem`, window=\"_blank\"] :: +++Quarkus attempts to automatically define a persistence unit when the Hibernate ORM extension is enabled, a default datasource is defined, and there are mapped entities. This build item represents the decision about creating such an implied persistence unit; it's modelled as a BuildItem so that other extensions can be aware of such a persistence unit being defined (e.g. Hibernate Reactive needs to know).+++"
